## @file
#  UefiShellGuiRW - read & write hardware resources under the UEFI Shell,
#  with an LVGL GUI (LVGLUefiGuiPkg) in the style of RW-Everything.
#
#  Copyright (c) 2026, Niall Tseng. All rights reserved.<BR>
